# The build tools of the release job. Pinned with hashes (requirements.txt next to it), because they
# decide the content of wheel and sdist: with a different setuptools a different archive
# results, and the published checksum could no longer be reproduced.
# Deliberately NOT `requirements.in`: with that name Dependabot would take requirements.txt for a
# pip-compile output and regenerate it with pip-compile instead of bumping the lines with their hashes.
build
setuptools
